  "simulation_rules": [
    "B1 is not a seventh/eighth developmental curriculum floor.",
    "B1 is omitted from the normal public/member floor selector, Journey Wall navigation and ordinary building directory.",
    "Live B1 access requires McCluster house-owner or explicitly delegated underground_operations_admin authority.",
    "Ordinary Equity Uprise admin/staff roles and competency status do not grant live B1 or tunnel access.",
    "Learners and instructors use a sandboxed training clone of B1/tunnel geometry; training cannot operate or reveal the live underground network.",
    "Protected stairs and the passenger elevator physically connect B1 to Floor 1 in the combined model for authorized operation and safe egress.",
    "Freight/service elevator physically serves B1 but remains restricted operational infrastructure.",
    "Future tunnel branches remain unlabeled reserved connections until a destination building has canonical authority.",
    "The model must preserve a clear distinction between training simulation, live operations and real-world professional engineering authority."
